    "This save reuses the column name %@ while the table is being recreated, and the recreated table would hold it twice. Save the change that frees the name first, then the one that takes it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cette sauvegarde réutilise le nom de la colonne %@ pendant que la table est recréée, et la table recréée la contiendra deux fois. Sauvegardez d'abord le changement qui libère le nom, puis celui qui le prend."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This save was made on a different connection. Open that connection to restore it." : {
      "localizations" : {
